@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Projectgroup a owl:Class .
hpc:Groupmember a owl:Class .
hpc:Project a owl:Class .
hpc:Hasdescription rdfs:domain hpc:Project .
hpc:Hasdescription rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Hasshares rdfs:domain hpc:Groupmember .
hpc:Hasshares rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:Hasownership rdfs:domain hpc:Groupmember .
hpc:Hasownership rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:Haspriority rdfs:domain hpc:Groupmember .
hpc:Haspriority rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:Hasnonshared rdfs:domain hpc:Groupmember .
hpc:Hasnonshared rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
hpc:Haslimits rdfs:domain hpc:Group .
hpc:Haslimits rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .

hpc:Group a owl:Class .
hpc:Groupmember a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines classes for ProjectGroup, GroupMember, and Project, as well as properties for describing each project group member, such as shares, ownership, non-shared, priority, and limits. The properties are defined as object properties, and their domains and ranges are specified using rdfs:domain and rdfs:range. The ProjectGroup class is a subclass of owl:Collection for better organization.
